"Firehose Mode can also work while you're driving if connected to a hotspot "
"or unlimited SIM card."
msgstr ""
"Para obtener la máxima efectividad, lleva tu dispositivo al"
"interior y conéctalo a un buen adaptador USB-C y a Wi-Fi"
